# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Datasets — NEVER COMMITTED.
#
# This repo distributes *links and documentation*, not data. Two reasons:
#   1. Size — the three primary corpora are ~3.2 GB on disk.
#   2. Licence — twcs is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Pushing it to a public repo is
#      redistribution, which would drag share-alike and attribution
#      obligations onto this repository.
#
# Download each dataset from the source URLs in ATTRIBUTION.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

01-harper-valley-bank/
02-abcd/
03-twitter-twcs/
04-apptek/
05-anonymousbank/

# Secondary corpora, if a contributor pulls them locally
secondary/
callcenter-en-90k/
anonymousbank/
apptek/

# Loose dataset archives and bulk data formats
*.wav
*.mp3
*.rar
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.mdb
*.parquet
*.arrow
*.pt
*.bin

# Large text/tabular data — but keep small docs-adjacent CSVs reviewable by
# force-adding them: `git add -f path/to/small.csv`
*.csv
*.tsv
*.jsonl

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.kgvenv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credentials — never commit. Datasets that need auth (e.g. Kaggle) read
# these from .env in the repo root (see .env.example) or from the user's
# home directory. .env.example is the committed template and holds no secrets.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
kaggle.json
access_token
*.pem
*.key
credentials

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Agent / tooling scratch
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.kiro/
_probes/
/tmp/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Curated conversations whose source licence does not permit redistribution.
#
# HarperValleyBank (CC BY 4.0) and ABCD (MIT) excerpts ARE committed, under
# curated/conversations/. twcs is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 -- share-alike conflicts with
# this repo's CC BY 4.0, platform terms on republishing post text are unresolved,
# and the excerpts contain personal details of identifiable people. Those are
# written to conversations-local/ and stay off the remote.
#
# Regenerate locally:  python3 curated/build/build_curated.py
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
curated/conversations-local/

# Readable renderings -- generated by the build, and a line-for-line duplicate
# of the JSON in curated/conversations/. Committing both means every conversation
# lives in the repo twice, and rerunning the sampler rewrites ~12,000 lines.
curated/conversations-*.md

